// Three-level obj.var.part from top level: write and read a part on a
// specific object's field.  b1.Led.pin = 21 targets b1's per-object slot;
// X reads it back (3-level LDP), and the module's own rule P = Led.pin sees
// the same override via CURRENT.

#module Blinker
#digital Led out 0
#variable P
P = Led.pin ? 1
#end

#Blinker b1

#variable X

b1.Led.pin = 21 ? 1     // 3-level STP
X = b1.Led.pin    ? 1   // 3-level LDP -> 21
